commit 37b84fb6425485bd5f2ab0396885a9a9d616e47c
Date: Fri May 24 15:33:05 2013 -0400

Remove unchecked cast in AbstractElement#equals()

Modify AbstractElement's equals() method to eliminate potential
unchecked casts while attempting to stay as close as possible to the
behavior of the original implementation.

closes #286

diff --git a/titan-core/src/main/java/com/thinkaurelius/titan/graphdb/internal/AbstractElement.java b/titan-core/src/main/java/com/thinkaurelius/titan/graphdb/internal/AbstractElement.java
